Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Restore imageHero override; fix mistyped hero/image
 filenames

layouts/_default/single.html had reverted to reading only .image for
the article banner, silently dropping the imageHero override added
earlier. Separately, the actual files on disk were named
theory-practice-hero..png (stray double dot) and theory-practice.pNG
(mixed-case extension), neither of which matched the frontmatter's
lowercase .png references -- both would 404 on a case-sensitive host.
Renamed the files to match and restored the template logic.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012i8cAvLnh91Z7YqXBqp4CS
---
 layouts/_default/single.html                        |   8 ++++++--
 ...-practice-hero..png => theory-practice-hero.png} | Bin
 .../{theory-practice.pNG => theory-practice.png}    | Bin
 3 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 rename static/img/{theory-practice-hero..png => theory-practice-hero.png} (100%)
 rename static/img/{theory-practice.pNG => theory-practice.png} (100%)

diff --git a/layouts/_default/single.html b/layouts/_default/single.html
index 9a23331..1bb1355 100644
--- a/layouts/_default/single.html
+++ b/layouts/_default/single.html
@@ -10,8 +10,12 @@
   <div class="progress-bar" id="progressBar"></div>
 </div>
 
-{{/* ── COVER IMAGE ── */}}
-{{ with .Params.image }}
+{{/* ── COVER IMAGE ──
+     imageHero overrides image for the article-page banner only; every
+     other context (cards, calendar, og:image, etc.) keeps using image
+     directly, so posts that only set image are unaffected. */}}
+{{ $heroImage := .Params.imageHero | default .Params.image }}
+{{ with $heroImage }}
 <div class="cover-wrap">
   <picture>
     {{ with $.Params.imageMobile }}
diff --git a/static/img/theory-practice-hero..png b/static/img/theory-practice-hero.png
similarity index 100%
rename from static/img/theory-practice-hero..png
rename to static/img/theory-practice-hero.png
diff --git a/static/img/theory-practice.pNG b/static/img/theory-practice.png
similarity index 100%
rename from static/img/theory-practice.pNG
rename to static/img/theory-practice.png
